  "description": "The Aerium Race is a high performance machine for podium-chasing triathletes and time triallists. Developed to help dedicated atheletes pare their times down to the bone, the superior carbon frame and performance-orientated equipment package are both optimised in every detail. With Shimano's new Ultegra gears, a CUBE Aerium carbon aero fork and Mavic wheelset, you've everything you need to smash out some new personal bests - and get a foot on the podium. It's the perfect symbiosis of ultimate performance, refined aerodynamics and surprising value. You just ran out of excuses... but you also increased your chances of beating the competition.",
